  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "きけんなＵＢの　いっしゅ。　すさまじい\nそくどで　だいちを　しっそうする\nすがたが　もくげき　されている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "위험한 UB 중 1마리이다. 굉장한\n속도로 대지를 질주하는\n모습이 목격되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "屬於危險ＵＢ的一種。\n被人目擊到以駭人的速度\n在大地狂奔的樣子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’une des dangereuses Ultra-Chimères.\nOn l’aurait aperçue en train de courir à\nune vitesse prodigieuse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese bedrohliche Ultrabestie wurde dabei\nbeobachtet, wie sie mit ungeheuerlicher\nGeschwindigkeit über die Erde hinwegfegt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Uno de los temibles Ultraentes. Se dice\nque ha sido avistado recorriendo la superficie\nterrestre a velocidades de vértigo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una delle temibili Ultracreature.\nÈ stata avvistata mentre correva a una velocità\nimpressionante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "One of the dangerous Ultra Beasts, it has been\nspotted running across the land at\nterrific speeds.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "危険なＵＢの　一種。　凄まじい\n速度で　大地を　疾走する\n姿が　目撃　されている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "危险究极异兽中的一种。\n被人目击到以骇人的速度\n在大地狂奔的样子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Uno de los temibles Ultraentes. Se dice\nque ha sido avistado recorriendo la superficie\nterrestre a velocidades de vértigo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢの　いっしゅ。　このせかいの\nものに　けがれを　かんじるのか\nいっさい　てを　ふれようと　しない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "UB의 일종. 이 세계의\n물건에 불결함을 느끼는 것인지\n전혀 손을 대려 하지 않는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢ的一種。\n或許是覺得這個世界上萬物污穢不堪，\n因此不願用手觸及分毫。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "L’une des Ultra-Chimères. Elle semble refuser\nde toucher les choses de ce monde, comme si\ntout était souillé à ses yeux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese Ultrabestie scheint diese Welt für unrein\nzu halten und zieht es daher vor, mit nichts und\nniemandem in Berührung zu kommen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Ultraente se muestra reacio al contacto,\nprobablemente porque percibe inmundicia en\ntodo cuanto le rodea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un’Ultracreatura che cerca di evitare ogni\ncontatto con le cose di questo mondo, come\nse lo considerasse contaminato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "One of the Ultra Beasts. It refuses to touch\nanything, perhaps because it senses some\nuncleanness in this world.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ＵＢの　一種。　この世界の\nものに　けがれを　感じるのか\n一切　手を　触れようと　しない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "究极异兽中的一种。\n或许是觉得这个世界上万物污秽不堪，\n因此不愿用手触及分毫。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Ultraente se muestra reacio al contacto,\nprobablemente porque percibe inmundicia en\ntodo cuanto le rodea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "べつせかいに　すむ　せいめいたい。\nほそく　しなやかな　からだ　だが\nつよいパワーを　ひめている　ようす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다른 세계에 사는 생명체다.\n가늘고 부드러운 몸이지만,\n강한 파워를 간직하고 있는 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "棲息在其他世界的生命體。\n身體纖細柔軟，\n但似乎蘊藏著強大的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Une forme de vie venant d’un autre monde.\nSon corps gracile cache une puissance\ninsoupçonnée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein Lebewesen aus einer anderen Welt. Sein\nKörper ist schmal und anmutig, doch es verbirgt\nsich große Kraft darin.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una forma de vida procedente de otro mundo.\nAunque su cuerpo es esbelto y flexible, alberga\nun gran poder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una forma di vita proveniente da un altro mondo.\nIl suo corpo esile e flessibile nasconde una forza\ninaspettata.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A life-form that lives in another world, its body\nis thin and supple, but it also possesses\ngreat power.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "別世界に　棲む　生命体。\n細く　しなやかな　身体　だが\n強いパワーを　秘めている　様子。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "栖息在其他世界的生命体。\n身体纤细柔软，\n但是看起来蕴藏着强大的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una forma de vida procedente de otro mundo.\nAunque su cuerpo es esbelto y flexible, alberga\nun gran poder.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "このせかいでは　いしつで　きけんだが\nほんらい　すんでいる　せかいでは\nふつうに　みかける　せいぶつらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "이 세계와는 성질이 다르고\n위험하지만 원래 살던 세계에서는\n흔히 볼 수 있는 생물인 듯하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在這個世界是危險的異類，\n但牠在原本棲息的世界裡\n似乎是隨處可見的普通生物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cette créature venue d’ailleurs est dangereuse\ndans notre monde, mais il semblerait qu’elle soit\ntrès commune dans le sien.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "In dieser Welt wirkt sein Aussehen gefährlich\nund fremdartig, doch in seiner ursprünglichen\nWelt ist es ein ganz gewöhnliches Lebewesen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para los seres de este mundo resulta extraño\ny peligroso, pero en el mundo del que procede\nes una criatura muy común.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nel nostro mondo il suo aspetto appare strano\ne minaccioso, ma sembra che in quello da cui\nproviene sia una creatura molto comune.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it’s alien to this world and a danger\nhere, it’s apparently a common organism in the\nworld where it normally lives.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "この世界では　異質で　危険だが\n本来　棲んでいる　世界では\n普通に　見かける　生物らしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在这个世界是异类，很危险，\n但在它原本栖息的世界，\n好像只是寻常能见的生物。",
      "language": {
